/*
 * The sticker factory under the footer links, drawn as one decorative SVG. Left to right:
 * the drawing desk (Rosa), the press puffing "plop" (Jun), the die-cut stamp (Mika), and the
 * conveyor carrying stickers into the pack Ben holds. FooterFactory adds the lever and the pause button.
 *
 * Motion is CSS keyframes in the scene's own <style>, so it still runs without JavaScript and
 * arrives only with the scene. Each moving element has class "fx fx-N"; timings and keyTimes are
 * the old SMIL loops' (#85), with linear steps as SMIL had. The conveyor stickers' path is
 * sampled into translate keyframes. footer.module.css pauses every .fx under [data-paused] and,
 * with reduced motion, sets --fx-shift so the paused scene rests on a nice frame.
 *
 * Colors and fonts sit in style attributes because SVG presentation attributes can't read
 * CSS variables. Each station is a <g class="pop"> so the footer can pop it up on scroll.
 */
